WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
Sister Yong, please stop taking advantage of misunderstandings and extorting money.

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:03,800
Brother Tong, you are fair

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:10,770
It’s the first time you meet your sister-in-law. You can’t go empty-handed, right? Liu Jingjing

4
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,100
Qingqing, don't go crazy

5
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:17,420
Boss, the gift you just promised to give is too expensive.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,420
That set of imperial green bracelets and diamond necklaces cost tens of millions

7
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,700
She must not be a student

8
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:24,020
It's okay. It's just two small items. I can afford it as a gift, but I have a worry.

9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,260
Giving you such an expensive thing will get you married in the future.

10
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:27,500
Will your husband misunderstand you?

11
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,700
Have a bad impact on you

12
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,010
Yeah, that's a big problem

13
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:30,970
If there is a root problem in the South

14
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:32,050
Even if you jump into the Yellow River, you won’t be able to wash yourself away.

15
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:32,970
Qingqing, you must not accept it

16
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:33,890
What's there to worry about?

17
00:00:33,890 --> 00:00:36,170
Then I will say that my brother-in-law and my sister gave it to me in a legitimate way.

18
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:37,650
Besides, I never thought about getting married.

19
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:39,290
I am determined to be a big star

20
00:00:39,290 --> 00:00:41,130
If you are under forty, you won’t even think about marriage.

21
00:00:41,530 --> 00:00:42,610
It’s really Ling Ya’s determination

22
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:43,970
This girl is so obsessed with money

23
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:45,050
She made a casual joke

24
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,810
She treated her as a brother-in-law and climbed up the ladder

25
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:48,650
My status in the boss's heart is not as high as others'

26
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:49,890
How dare you accept such a big gift?

27
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,290
But it will take some time before the gesture is ready
